<!-- ─── §03 ARCHITECTURE ─────────────────────────────────── -->
<section id="s-arch" data-code="arch">
<div class="section-no">03 — RAEv2 Architecture</div>
<h2>One unified pipeline: encoder, diffusion, REPA, guidance</h2>

<p>RAEv2 replaces the VAE in a standard DiT setup. The pretrained vision encoder (DINOv3-L, 24 layers) encodes the image into a rich latent. The diffusion transformer (DDT-XL) denoises in that space. Two prediction heads share the forward pass: the full model output head (predicts x from all layers) and the lightweight REPA head (predicts x from early layers only).</p>

