<h2>State-of-the-art at 80 epochs — 10× fewer than before</h2>

<p>The three improvements stack multiplicatively. Each change alone speeds convergence; together they produce a model that reaches gFID 1.06 in just 80 epochs — where the original RAE took 800 epochs to reach 1.13.</p>

